Cell["\<\
Downfold a two-layer block-tridiagonal Hamiltonian in the same photon \
ordering.\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->607248877,ExpressionUUID->"7547bde8-446a-5042-a551-c8928f41de57"],

